### Versioned API Testing
### Test both v1 and v2 through APIM

### Variables
@apimGateway = your-apim-name.azure-api.net
@subscriptionKey = your-subscription-key-here
@baseUrl = https://{{apimGateway}}

### Local testing (if running locally)
# @baseUrl = https://localhost:7001

###############################################################################
### VERSION 1 Tests
###############################################################################

### V1 - Get all products
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V1 - Get product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V1 - Get product by ID - Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/999
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V1 - Create product (basic fields only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

{
  "name": "Monitor",
  "price": 299.99
}

### V1 - Update product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

{
  "name": "Updated Laptop",
  "price": 899.99
}

### V1 - Delete product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

###############################################################################
### VERSION 2 Tests
###############################################################################

### V2 - Get all products (basic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Get all products with category filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products?category=Electronics
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Get all products with price range
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products?minPrice=50&maxPrice=500
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Get all products - in stock only
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products?inStock=true
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Get all products - complex filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products?category=Electronics&minPrice=100&maxPrice=1000&inStock=true
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Get product by ID (enhanced response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Search products (NEW in v2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/search?query=laptop
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Search products - empty query
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/search?query=
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Get products by category (NEW in v2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/category/Electronics
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Get products by category - case insensitive
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/category/electronics
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Create product (requires full details in v2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v2/products
Content-Type: application/json
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

{
  "name": "4K Monitor",
  "description": "Ultra HD 4K monitor with HDR",
  "price": 399.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "stock": 30,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/monitor.jpg"
}

### V2 - Create product - missing category (should fail in v2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v2/products
Content-Type: application/json
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

{
  "name": "Monitor",
  "description": "A monitor",
  "price": 299.99,
  "stock": 10
}

### V2 - Update product (full update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

{
  "name": "Premium Laptop",
  "description": "High-end gaming laptop with RTX graphics",
  "price": 1499.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "stock": 25,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/premium-laptop.jpg"
}

### V2 - Update stock (NEW in v2 - PATCH endpoint)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/1/stock?quantity=100
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Update stock - zero quantity
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/1/stock?quantity=0
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Delete product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

###############################################################################
### Comparing V1 vs V2 Responses
###############################################################################

### Same endpoint, different versions - Compare responses!

### V1 Response (basic fields)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 Response (enhanced fields)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

###############################################################################
### Version-Specific Features
###############################################################################

### Try V2-only endpoint on V1 (should 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/search?query=laptop
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### Try V2-only endpoint on V2 (should work)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/search?query=laptop
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### Try V2-only category endpoint on V1 (should 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/category/Electronics
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### Try V2-only category endpoint on V2 (should work)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/category/Electronics
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

###############################################################################
### Error Cases
###############################################################################

### V1 - Product not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/99999
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Product not found (enhanced error response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products/99999
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### Wrong version in URL - should 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/products
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### No version in URL - should fail
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

###############################################################################
### Performance Comparison
###############################################################################

### V1 - Simple query (baseline)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Same query (check if overhead)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### V2 - Complex query with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products?category=Electronics&minPrice=50&maxPrice=1000&inStock=true
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

###############################################################################
### Verify Version Headers (if configured)
###############################################################################

### Check if API returns version info in headers
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}

### Should show api-supported-versions in response headers
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/products
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}
